        "SourceString": "Investigate the election in Bradford.",
        "LocalizedString": "Investigate the election in Bradford."
      },
      "Summary": {
        "Namespace": "",
        "Key": "D80D989E4D991ABFDDCDD19B5A3B84FA",
        "SourceString": "There’s something suspicious about the outcome of the Bradford Elder election. Amelia and I are going to investigate.",
        "LocalizedString": "There’s something suspicious about the outcome of the Bradford Elder election. Amelia and I are going to investigate."
      },
      "CompletionText": {
        "Namespace": "",
        "Key": "C56993CA446C3D4FF7C5F181434FBCFE",
        "SourceString": "Ashbourne and Loxley had crossed a line they could never come back from. Now, there was no room left for hesitation or doubt—the fight for justice had just become a fight for survival. The village needed to be rallied, weapons gathered, and allies found. If a revolution was coming, we'd need every bit of strength and resolve to bring them down. There was no turning back now.",
        "LocalizedString": "Ashbourne and Loxley had crossed a line they could never come back from. Now, there was no room left for hesitation or doubt—the fight for justice had just become a fight for survival. The village needed to be rallied, weapons gathered, and allies found. If a revolution was coming, we'd need every bit of strength and resolve to bring them down. There was no turning back now."
      },
